@startuml employee_fiche_sequence
title Fiche Employé — US07 (Consultation) & US08 (Modification)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam LifelineStrategy solid

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor        #3F51B5
    ActorBorderColor  #3F51B5
    ActorBackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    ParticipantBorderColor  #3F51B5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDBDBD
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    NoteBorderColor   #FBC02D
    GroupBackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    GroupBorderColor  #7E57C2
    GroupHeaderFontColor #4527A0
    GroupHeaderFontSize 13
}

'──────────────── Acteurs ────────────────
actor       "Administrateur RH"  as RH
participant "Angular UI"         as Angular
participant "Gateway\n(:8080)"   as Gateway
participant "EmployeeController" as Ctrl
participant "EmployeeService"    as Svc
participant "EmployeeRepository" as Repo
database    "MySQL"              as DB

'──────────────── Pré-requis ─────────────
ref over RH, Angular, Gateway
    Authentification préalable — JWT obtenu via Auth-Service / Keycloak
end ref

|||

'══════════════ US07 — Consultation ══════════════
group US07 — Consultation du dossier

RH    ->  Angular  : 1. Sélectionner un employé dans la liste
Angular -> Gateway  : 2. GET /api/employees/{id}\n     [Authorization: Bearer JWT]
Gateway -> Gateway  : 3. Valider le JWT (HS256)
Gateway -> Ctrl     : 4. GET /api/employees/{id}\n     [X-Auth-User · X-Auth-Roles]

Ctrl  ->  Svc   : 5. findById(id)
Svc   ->  Repo  : 6. findById(id)
Repo  ->  DB    : 7. SELECT * FROM employee\n   WHERE id = ?
DB    --> Repo  : 8. Données de l'employé

note right of Repo
  Si absent :
  ResourceNotFoundException
  → 404 Not Found
end note

Repo  --> Svc   : 9. Employee entity
Svc   ->  Svc   : 10. toDto(Employee)
Svc   --> Ctrl  : 11. EmployeeDTO
Ctrl  --> Gateway : 12. 200 OK (JSON)
Gateway --> Angular : 12. 200 OK (JSON)
Angular --> RH  : 13. Afficher le profil de l'employé

end

|||

'══════════════ US08 — Modification ══════════════
group US08 — Modification du dossier

RH    ->  Angular  : 14. Modifier les champs & valider
Angular -> Gateway  : 15. PUT /api/employees/{id}\n     [Body: EmployeeRequest · Bearer JWT]
Gateway -> Gateway  : 16. Valider JWT\n     + rôle HR_ADMIN ou MANAGER

note right of Gateway
  403 Forbidden
  si rôle insuffisant
end note

Gateway -> Ctrl  : 17. PUT /api/employees/{id}\n     [Body: EmployeeRequest]

note right of Ctrl
  @PreAuthorize(
    "hasAuthority('HR_ADMIN')
     or hasAuthority('MANAGER')")
end note

Ctrl  ->  Svc   : 18. update(id, EmployeeRequest)
Svc   ->  Repo  : 19. findById(id)
Repo  --> Svc   : 20. Employee entité existante
Svc   ->  Svc   : 21. fromRequest(emp, req)\n     — mise à jour des champs
Svc   ->  Repo  : 22. save(Employee)
Repo  ->  DB    : 23. UPDATE employee\n   SET ... WHERE id = ?
DB    --> Repo  : 24. Confirmation SQL
Repo  --> Svc   : 25. Employee sauvegardé
Svc   ->  Svc   : 26. toDto(Employee)
Svc   --> Ctrl  : 27. EmployeeDTO mis à jour
Ctrl  --> Gateway : 28. 200 OK
Gateway --> Angular : 28. 200 OK
Angular --> RH  : 29. "Dossier mis à jour avec succès"

end

@enduml
